            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "https://api.smokeball.com/subscriptions/:id",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The unique identifier of the subscription to update"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Updates a subscriptions tiers, add-ons, or interval.\r\n\r\nImportant considerations:\r\n* Updates cannot be made to canceled subscriptions\r\n* Billing will be prorated for the remaining period\r\n* Existing add-ons may need to be re-validated\r\n* Some features may be disabled if not available in new tier or add-ons"
        },
